# Line endings.
#
# The repository stores LF; a Windows checkout gets CRLF, which matches the
# existing `core.autocrlf=true` configuration. Declaring it explicitly stops a
# stray LF-only write from showing up as a whole-file diff, and stops a tool
# that writes LF from fighting the checkout.
* text=auto
*.rs text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never touched by the end-of-line machinery.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.safetensors binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
